(self.webpackChunksite=self.webpackChunksite||[]).push([[748],{4367:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"hugo-defense","title":"Hugo\'s Defense","authors":[{"name":"Felipe Almeida Gomes","contact":"feagomes","contactType":"github","contactUrl":"https://github.com/feagomes"}],"date":1783468800000,"readme":"<p>Welcome to <strong>Hugo\'s Defense</strong>! This is a unique hybrid game for the WASM-4 fantasy console that combines classic Tower Defense mechanics with a rogue-like restart, where if you die you got to start all over again.</p>\\n<h2>Gameplay</h2>\\n<p>Defend your base against waves of incoming enemies while keeping an eye on Hugo\'s Tower. Manage his Damage, Attack, and Health.</p>\\n<p>Survive through 10 waves of increasingly difficult bad goblins, culminating in an epic Boss Wave featuring the giant Grim Reaper!</p>\\n<h2>Controls</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Mouse/Click (or Touch):</strong> Interact with the UI buttons to buy upgrades for your tower and manage Hugo\'s stats.\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Upgrades &#x26; Economy</h2>\\n<p>Collect coins by defeating enemies to buy crucial upgrades for your defense:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>DAM (Damage):</strong> Increases the damage dealt by your tower\'s projectiles.</li>\\n<li><strong>SPD (Speed):</strong> Reduces the attack cooldown, making your tower shoot faster.</li>\\n<li><strong>HP (Health):</strong> Increases your tower\'s maximum health to withstand more hits.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Good luck, and whatever you do, keep Hugo alive!</p>"}')}}]);